latformer. Mix-match abilities and powers, explore levels that each feature unique mechanics and discover a branching storyline with over a hundred optional story and sex scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want to survive, you'll need to defy destiny with the power of the Future Fragments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238920/extras/a47c0e9da1b19a1d1455cf038195973e.poster.avif?t=1770663890\" width=597 height=151 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238920/extras/a47c0e9da1b19a1d1455cf038195973e.webm?t=1770663890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIXED-GENRE, ACTION-ADVENTURE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own unique mechanics and bosses with multiple attacks and phases. Unlock their abilities and powers, mix-match them with a large variety of powerups, and use them to navigate expansive levels and handle a range of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FUTURE DESPERATE FOR SEX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a desolate future where sex and relationships are deeply ingrained in its story. Experience over 100 hand-animated sex scenes through a variety of encounters!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238920/extras/435ac3dc0f0aa1103af0c5685138fb39.poster.avif?t=1770663890\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238920/extras/435ac3dc0f0aa1103af0c5685138fb39.webm?t=1770663890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238920/extras/435ac3dc0f0aa1103af0c5685138fb39.mp4?t=1770663890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A BRANCHING STORYLINE WITH CHOICES THAT MATTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With optional cutscenes where your choices matter and a morality system that shapes your character\u2019s personality, it all adds up to multiple completely unique endings to discover. Curious for more? Find databanks to learn even more about the story of Future Fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROFESSIONAL VOICEWORK, SOUNDTRACK, AND MORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes many, many hours of professional English voicework across many, many NPCs as well as an hours-long soundtrack, plus numerous quality of life options including fully remappable controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238920/extras/10fd1fd9f298692ef08131473638be60.poster.avif?t=1770663890\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238920/extras/10fd1fd9f298692ef08131473638be60.webm?t=1770663890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238920/extras/10fd1fd9f298692ef08131473638be60.mp4?t=1770663890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BACKSTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 1000 AD, your king, the strongest sorcerer in the land, has failed to defend against an enemy alliance formed specifically to crush your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a last-ditch effort, he opened a portal to the year 3000 AD, where the fragments of a powerful weapon lay dormant. The king\u2019s orders were simple: get the fragments and return home safely. The magician who brings back the most fragments will become the king\u2019s right hand woman, with all the power that brings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immediately after traveling to the future though, you're faced with &quot;The World Organization for Regulation of the Masses&quot; (WORM), the global power that's outlawed sex to increase productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Thus, the people from this era are very, VERY desperate for sex...</i></strong></p>","developers":["The Future Fragments Team"],"dlc":[1327950],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238920/header.jpg?t=1770663890","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1238920/283318/32c9c86ac788f12bf07ffe370ffd5bed7054f375/1750648007/dash_av1.mpd?t=1708520555","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1238920/283318/32c9c86ac788f12bf07ffe370ffd5bed7054f375/1750648007/dash_h264.mpd?t=1708520555","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1238920/283318/32c9c86ac788f12bf07ffe370ffd5bed7054f375/1750648007/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1708520555","id":256784297,"name":"Future Fragments English Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256784297/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1708520555"}],"name":"Future Fragments","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text"